OL,3,GNEWSAHow online predator duped 70 girls
OL,4,Ainto believing he loved them           
OL,6,FOver the course of four years, student 
OL,7,FBilal Kazi manipulated and groomed at  
OL,8,Fleast 70 girls from across the UK - but
OL,9,Fpolice fear there could be more than   
OL,10,F100 further victims yet to be          
OL,11,Fidentified.                            
OL,13,FKazi, who was aged between 22 and 26 at
OL,14,Fthe time, led his victims to believe   
OL,15,Fthey were in a relationship with a     
OL,16,F14-year-old boy named Reece.           
OL,18,FBut the reality was far more sinister. 
