OL,3,GNEWSAHow online predator duped 70 girls
OL,4,Ainto believing he loved them           
OL,6,FKazi, 27, was sentenced to 30 years in 
OL,7,Fprison last week after pleading guilty 
OL,8,Fto 37 charges including making indecent
OL,9,Fimages, blackmail and inciting a child 
OL,10,Fto engage in sexual activity.          
